# mpd.env — per-project configuration for a bare (trixie) project.
# Seeded once at `mpd create <project>` time. Edit directly, or via
# `mpd configure <project> KEY=VALUE` (Swift sanitises and rewrites lines).
#
# Bare projects have no defaults beyond what the project itself provides.
# This file exists for parity with other project types — most users won't
# need to add anything here.

# Database engine + version. Bare projects don't use a database — explicit
# empty value here blocks fall-through to any MPD_DB=... that the developer
# may have set in mpd-user.env.
MPD_DB=""
